OL,3,GNEWSACalls for city's nature reserve to
OL,4,Abe maintained
OL,5,
OL,6,FA motion calling for the long-term
OL,7,Fmaintenance of a city's nature reserve
OL,8,Fwill be debated by councillors on
OL,9,FThursday.
OL,11,FJohn Fox, a Peterborough First
OL,12,FCouncillor for Werrington on
OL,13,FPeterborough City Council, submitted a
OL,14,Fmotion urging the authority to take
OL,15,Faction at Cuckoo's Hollow, claiming
OL,16,Fthat the area could be a flooding risk.
OL,18,FThe green space in Werrington serves as
OL,19,Fa drainage basin for surface water from
OL,20,FWerrington Brook, Paston Brook and
OL,21,FMarholm Brook, and is also a habitat
OL,22,Ffor wildlife.
OL,23,APub: 13-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,379,370,200,160,0,100
